<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH UTILITY Q1 GROSS PROFIT DIPS.</title>
<headline>CZECH UTILITY Q1 GROSS PROFIT DIPS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		536.22   vs	  752.77</p>
<p> Operating profit	  533.66   vs	  755.85</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services	    1,670.45   vs	1,993.25</p>
<p> Total assets	    7,679.64   vs	8,052.78</p>
<p> Basic capital	   4,147.88   vs	4,147.88</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Prazska Teplarenska a.s.. The</p>
<p>firm is Prague's heating supplier. Its shares are traded on the</p>
<p>main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
